     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:\u0120pick(raw_meat_1)\u0120place(raw_meat_1,\u0120grill)\u0120close(grill_lid)\u0120pick(raw_meat_1)\u0120place(raw_meat_1,\u0120plate)",
